OL,4,BDe Bruyne's feelings for Man City will 
OL,5,B'never change'                         
OL,6,GKevin de Bruyne says his feelings for  
OL,7,GManchester City will "never change"    
OL,8,Geven if the club are stripped of their 
OL,9,Gtitles after being found guilty of     
OL,10,Gbreaching the Premier League's         
OL,11,Gfinancial rules.                       
OL,13,FDe Bruyne, 35, enjoyed a trophy-laden  
OL,14,Fdecade at Etihad Stadium, lifting 16   
OL,15,Ftrophies including the Treble in 2023  
OL,16,Fbefore leaving on a free transfer to   
OL,17,Fjoin Napoli in 2025.                   
OL,19,FThe Belgian returns to City for the    
OL,20,Fsecond time on Tuesday when Napoli     
OL,21,Fplay them in the Champions League.     
